WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.375
In enterprise RAG, retrieving a relevant document chunk never guarantees an accurate citation.

2
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:11.377
NIST AI 600-1 calls for provenance grounding: lock exact spans, match numbers, and test entailment.

3
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.384
Compare each generated claim against its exact page and table cell before showing any answer.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.408
If the retrieved span does not entail the claim, block generation and abstain cleanly.

5
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.384
Never trust unverified footnotes. Inspect page-and-cell RAG citation gates in OmniRAG.
